{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`MOVE`,`title`:`The Dance Competition`,`titleVN`:`Cu\u1ed9c thi nh\u1ea3y`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Tuan`,`vn`:`Tu\u1ea5n, 17 tu\u1ed5i, tr\u01b0\u1edfng nh\u00f3m nh\u1ea3y \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng ph\u1ed1, n\u0103ng n\u1ed5`},{`name`:`Tham`,`vn`:`Th\u1eafm, 16 tu\u1ed5i, nh\u1ea3y d\u1ebbo nh\u1ea5t nh\u00f3m`},{`name`:`Bo`,`vn`:`B\u01a1, 15 tu\u1ed5i, v\u1ee5ng v\u1ec1 nh\u01b0ng r\u1ea5t ch\u0103m`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A2`,`part`:1,`parts`:1,`title`:`Falling and Getting Up`,`titleVN`:`Ng\u00e3 r\u1ed3i l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ee9ng d\u1eady`,`words`:`search|missing|collect|remove|cross|reach|enter|receive|provide|use|movement|jump|catch|raise|hold|react|push|hit|avoid|cover|hide|throw`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[That]] [[night]], [[the]] [[friends|friend]] [[searched|search]] [[everywhere]] [[for]] [[the]] [[missing]] [[form]]. Tham [[said|say]], \`[[Let's|let]] [[search]] [[your]] [[bag]] [[again]], Bo.\` Bo [[always]] [[collected|collect]] [[things|thing]] [[in]] [[that]] [[bag]]. [[He]] [[removed|remove]] [[two]] [[bananas|banana]] [[and]] [[a]] [[very]] [[old]] [[sandwich]]. [[Under]] [[it]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[missing]] [[form]].`,`vn`:`T\u1ed1i h\u00f4m \u0111\u00f3, c\u1ea3 nh\u00f3m l\u1ee5c tung m\u1ecdi n\u01a1i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm t\u1edd \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t. Th\u1eafm n\u00f3i: \`B\u01a1, m\u00ecnh l\u1ee5c l\u1ea1i t\u00fai em l\u1ea7n n\u1eefa xem.\` B\u01a1 l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng gom \u0111\u1ee7 th\u1ee9 v\u00e0o chi\u1ebfc t\u00fai \u1ea5y. C\u1eadu l\u00f4i ra hai qu\u1ea3 chu\u1ed1i v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc b\u00e1nh m\u00ec k\u1eb9p \u0111\u00e3 r\u1ea5t c\u0169. B\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi l\u00e0 t\u1edd \u0111\u01a1n b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[next]] [[morning]], [[they]] [[crossed|cross]] [[the]] [[street]] [[and]] [[reached|reach]] [[the]] [[community]] [[hall]] [[at]] [[five]] [[to]] [[twelve]]. \`You're [[the]] [[last]] [[team]],\` [[said|say]] [[a]] [[woman]] [[there]]. \`[[Now]] [[you]] [[can]] [[enter]] [[the]] [[competition]].\` [[A]] [[week]] [[later]], [[they]] [[received|receive]] [[a]] [[letter]]: \`[[We]] [[provide]] [[a]] [[room]] [[for]] [[every]] [[team]]. [[Use]] [[it]] [[on]] [[Monday]] [[evenings|evening]].\``,`vn`:`S\u00e1ng h\u00f4m sau, c\u1ea3 nh\u00f3m b\u0103ng qua \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 t\u1edbi nh\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a l\u00fac m\u01b0\u1eddi hai gi\u1edd k\u00e9m n\u0103m. \`C\u00e1c ch\u00e1u l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9i cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea5y,\` m\u1ed9t c\u00f4 \u1edf \u0111\u00f3 n\u00f3i. \`Gi\u1edd th\u00ec c\u00e1c ch\u00e1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ef1 thi r\u1ed3i.\` M\u1ed9t tu\u1ea7n sau, h\u1ecd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u01b0: \`Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u1ed9i m\u1ed9t ph\u00f2ng t\u1eadp. C\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9i d\u00f9ng ph\u00f2ng v\u00e0o c\u00e1c t\u1ed1i th\u1ee9 Hai.\``},{`en`:`Tuan [[made|make]] [[a]] [[new]] [[movement]] [[for]] [[the]] [[end]]. [[In]] [[it]], Tham [[had|have]] [[to]] [[jump]], [[and]] [[the]] [[boys|boy]] [[had|have]] [[to]] [[catch]] [[her]] [[and]] [[raise]] [[her]] [[high]]. \`[[Hold]] [[her]] [[hands|hand]],\` [[said|say]] Tuan. \`[[Not]] [[her]] [[hair]]!\``,`vn`:`Tu\u1ea5n ngh\u0129 ra m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00e1c m\u1edbi cho \u0111o\u1ea1n k\u1ebft. Th\u1eafm b\u1eadt nh\u1ea3y, hai c\u1eadu con trai \u0111\u1ee1 l\u1ea5y c\u00f4 r\u1ed3i n\u00e2ng c\u00f4 l\u00ean cao. \`Gi\u1eef tay ch\u1ecb \u1ea5y,\` Tu\u1ea5n d\u1eb7n. \`\u0110\u1eebng t\u00fam t\u00f3c!\``},{`en`:`[[The]] [[first]] [[time]], Bo [[reacted|react]] [[too]] [[late]], [[and]] Tham [[fell|fall]] [[on]] [[him]]. [[Next]] [[time]], [[he]] [[pushed|push]] [[too]] [[hard]], [[and]] Tham [[almost]] [[hit]] [[the]] [[mirror]]. \`[[Please]] [[avoid]] [[the]] [[mirror]],\` [[she]] [[said|say]]. \`[[It's|it]] [[the]] [[only]] [[one]] [[we]] [[have]].\``,`vn`:`L\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u, B\u01a1 ph\u1ea3n \u1ee9ng ch\u1eadm qu\u00e1, th\u1ebf l\u00e0 Th\u1eafm r\u01a1i tr\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u